    PostWorkout summary payload gets a reader (OWED.md:730)
    
    The old backend's workout-complete payload reached the render completely unparsed - 34 bare reads across nine fields - while the other three old payloads on these screens each got a reader across T3 rounds 4-7. Kd deferred it at the PostWorkout XP card's plan gate ("record as OWED, fix XP only"); this discharges that line.
    
    Every defect was reproduced by a test written and shown RED before any source change (R9.5): an absent form score fell through every threshold to grade D / "Keep practicing" / red, a bad-form verdict on a workout nobody scored; formatTime(undefined) printed "NaNh NaNm" on the page AND in the PNG; calories printed "undefined kcal"; exercises_count rendered as nothing; a list arriving as a bare string passed length>0 then threw at .map, blanking the whole page (no ErrorBoundary in apps/web); and a 200 with no summary key stored undefined without throwing, so the catch never ran and the page rendered a blank white screen.
    
    readSummaryView + formGrade live in gamificationApi.js beside readStatsView, which parses a workoutService payload too, so the location is precedent not a new pattern. ONE grade ladder now serves the page and the share card; ShareCard's twin is deleted, so the PNG can no longer print "undefined% (D)".
    
    Kd's rulings at the gate: "Not scored" copy; the empty-200 case takes the page's existing toast+redirect; the zero-active-seconds fix folded in (0 is falsy, so a workout with no active movement silently showed the total-duration figure); the page/PNG calories rounding difference is report-only with its own OWED line.
    
    A REGRESSION THIS COMMIT SHIPPED, fixed and recorded because the pattern matters more than the bug: xp_earned survived the snake->camel rename at ONE of two sites, so the page's XP card read a dash for every workout while the PNG read +70 - and all 7 render tests stayed GREEN, because the whole-document sweep is satisfied by the SHARE CARD. Round 1 F1 verbatim, in the card that quotes round 1 F1. Found by grep, not by the tests. The missing per-site identity assertion now exists and its mutation is RED.
    
    PROVE: web 269 passed / 1 failed (270), the 1 being the known syncClient env quirk. +21 tests. 13 mutations, 13 RED, md5-guarded, sources restored byte-identical. vite build green. Lint parity measured at HEAD and after: 5 problems both times, all pre-existing. Package-wide 67/9 unchanged.
    
    OWED TICK WITHHELD pending Kd's browser smoke AND a fresh-chat T3. Smoke steps at RUNBOOK/smoke-postworkout-summary.md, healthy CONTROL first. Also folded in from earlier this session: the DECISIONS-INDEX ruling recorded in DECISIONS.md where it belongs, and an OWED line for cutover.md being stale.
    
